# The special tokens of the encoding `o200k_harmony`, the one OpenAI's
# gpt-oss models read: its ordinary tokens and its pattern are
# `o200k_base`'s, held equal by the program that wrote this module, and
# its 1091 special tokens are these. Nothing below this header is edited
# by hand: the one-off program `gen_tables.py`, which is not in the tree
# (defect 2639), read them from tiktoken 0.14.0 on 2026-11-18 and wrote this
# module whole.
#
# Taken from OpenAI's tiktoken, whose licence travels with it here, as its
# LICENSE states it:
